flowchart TD
    A[Read crons/tasks.yaml] --> B[Parse enabled tasks]
    B --> C[Read .miniclaw/task-state.json]
    C --> D[Find tasks due this minute]
    D --> E{Already ran in slot?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Skip task]
    E -- No --> G[Execute task]
    G --> H{Success?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Update last_run]
    H -- No --> J[Update last_error]
